/**
 * Brand-rejection tests for DeleteTenantModal — C1 TranslatedString rollout.
 *
 * DeleteTenantModal previously passed raw string literals to Modal.title and Modal.eyebrow.
 * After the brand rollout those call sites use unsafeAsTranslated() with i18n-allow comments.
